# playpick cell: mode=menus view=820x1180,touch save=carried
#
# Retry of -3.play: that attempt tapped outcome:retry one line too early
# (the boss was at 1% hp, still finishing itself off by DoT, so the button
# did not exist yet -- fault:no-such-control -- and the follow-up
# waitscreen/play calls just re-read the same first kill rather than
# starting a second pull). Same experiment, with a wait before checking
# state and only tapping retry once outcome reads victory.
open #b=marrow&s=10&h=0
tap class:warrior:arms
tap pull
waitscreen fight 15
play good 130
wait 3
state
shot kill1

tap outcome:retry
waitscreen fight 15
play good 130
wait 3
state
shot kill2
says

targets
key Escape
targets
tap back
targets
shot home
